          "en": "They would stay somewhere for a while, plant crops, and then move on."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pasaron por Coatepec, por Tula y por Chapultepec. En muchos lugares no los querían.",
          "en": "They passed through Coatepec, Tula and Chapultepec. In many places, they were not welcome."
